WEBVTT

00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:05.120
Open Commerce, Bookings.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:11.054
It lists bookings from today on, with the product, the buyer, the status and the date.

00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:18.484
Filter by status, such as Requested, Confirmed, Completed, No-shows or Canceled, show any

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:21.568
date, or search by buyer or product.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:25.521
Calendar shows each day's dates with what is taken.

